# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# credentials and local config - NEVER commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Only *.example configuration files belong in this repository. A real inventory
# names real databases, a real servers table names real machines, and a real env
# file holds real passwords: none of the three is ours to publish.

.env
.env.*
*-env
.repv-env
.repv-test-env
.couchdb-*env

# real configs, next to the examples they were copied from
repv-inventory.csv
repv-servers.csv
.repv-test-inventory.csv
.repv-test-servers.csv

# ...but the examples themselves are the point
!*.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# editor and tooling droppings
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*~
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
*.orig
*.rej
.aider*
.DS_Store
